  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 405.03 Secondary Containment for Tanks",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 405.03 Secondary Containment for Tanks. The secondary containment required by Env-Or 405.01(b) shall have access ports that:\n\n(a) Allow access without the need for excavation; and\n\n(b) Are protected against unauthorized access and tampering.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Or 400) #10393, eff 9-1-13; ss by #12643, eff 10-10-18 (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Or 400)",
